        },
        {
          "text": "Ngemva kwakhe oHananiya indodana kaShelemiya loHanuni indodana yesithupha kaZalafi bakha enye indawo. Ngemva kwabo kwakha uMeshulamu indodana kaBerekiya maqondana lendlwana yakhe. ",
          "type": "text",
