        },
        {
          "text": "Ngemva kwakhe kwakha uMalikiya omunye wabakhandi bensimbi waze waba sendlini yezinceku zasethempelini leyabathengi maqondana leSango laBalindi, kusiya endlini engaphezu kwengonsi. ",
